  "stem": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861842-114651791852237200-K0G_tUEVAQoyIykkjeGfWrT-ASEoUiMcxVoWY8872hg0VcBxHZpMRdNZ4lgTN_du\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">氯化钛</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ac4e832bb0ad48fce346714b68459ac3.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">可用于制造烟幕、织物媒染剂、人造珍珠等。常温下为无色液体，沸点为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/040fa0ce82587bf180dc7a5aea1d1371.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，与水剧烈反应产生白烟。实验室利用反应</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b2b0cd016fe06d967c16d0daf0aa27a3.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">制备</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/788eaf057c2b96ec53d2cac6a6a8cb83.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。回答下列问题：</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">I</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．甲组同学拟用下列装置制取纯净干燥的氯气</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">不用收集</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img  height=\"128\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/1/9/db9fe8ca-229b-4a91-b6ca-5f4d2448c183.png\" width=\"197\" /></p><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861842-114651791852237200-K0G_tUEVAQoyIykkjeGfWrT-ASEoUiMcxVoWY8872hg0VcBxHZpMRdNZ4lgTN_du\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（1）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">装置</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">B</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中盛放的试剂是</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"1\" size=\"11\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，装置</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的作用是</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"2\" size=\"11\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div></div><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861842-114651791852237200-K0G_tUEVAQoyIykkjeGfWrT-ASEoUiMcxVoWY8872hg0VcBxHZpMRdNZ4lgTN_du\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（2）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">装置</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中发生反应的离子方程式为</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"3\" size=\"11\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div></div><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861842-114651791852237200-K0G_tUEVAQoyIykkjeGfWrT-ASEoUiMcxVoWY8872hg0VcBxHZpMRdNZ4lgTN_du\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（3）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在制取氯化钛</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ac4e832bb0ad48fce346714b68459ac3.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">实验开始时，先通入干燥</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/f5547e0098754a8e3f31bae5d5bcb4dd.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的目的是</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"4\" size=\"11\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">II</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．乙组同学选用甲组实验中的装置</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ff4489d9b83072184c0e1d6b09be50ca.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/933196d1ad44ee923ea94d55814a0198.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ca66a268d6f46e0e9d5d9151b785be60.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和下列装置</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">装置可重复使用</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">制取</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/788eaf057c2b96ec53d2cac6a6a8cb83.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">并验证反应中有</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/e5a122e25cf4eb9f03ffe5ec823bfc31.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">生成。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img  height=\"104\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/1/9/faab5a27-6f88-4505-9b37-2ac32866d05c.png\" width=\"632\" /></p><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861842-114651791852237200-K0G_tUEVAQoyIykkjeGfWrT-ASEoUiMcxVoWY8872hg0VcBxHZpMRdNZ4lgTN_du\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（4）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">乙组同学的实验装置中，依次连接的合理顺序为</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"5\" size=\"11\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"6\" size=\"11\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/f23842f79eb9458b27e9efa2e3bccc7a.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">___________</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/370f60b08759485072f1e43237788b0f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">___________</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/370f60b08759485072f1e43237788b0f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">___________</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0692d91fab19782617f1514336eb6cba.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">___________</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/370f60b08759485072f1e43237788b0f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">___________</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div></div><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861842-114651791852237200-K0G_tUEVAQoyIykkjeGfWrT-ASEoUiMcxVoWY8872hg0VcBxHZpMRdNZ4lgTN_du\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（5）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">能证明反应中有</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/e5a122e25cf4eb9f03ffe5ec823bfc31.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">生成的现象是</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"7\" size=\"11\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div></div><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861842-114651791852237200-K0G_tUEVAQoyIykkjeGfWrT-ASEoUiMcxVoWY8872hg0VcBxHZpMRdNZ4lgTN_du\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（6）</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/788eaf057c2b96ec53d2cac6a6a8cb83.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">与水剧烈反应生成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b9bc62318e844fae960d7a39386196ee.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和另一种酸性气体，反应的化学方程式为</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"8\" size=\"11\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div></div></div>",
  "answer": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-answer\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861842-114651791852237200-K0G_tUEVAQoyIykkjeGfWrT-ASEoUiMcxVoWY8872hg0VcBxHZpMRdNZ4lgTN_du\">（1）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;①. <span class=\"qml-an  \"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">饱和食盐水</span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;②. <span class=\"qml-an  \"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">除去</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/5d69d7191f7166d1c82e92bd9c6ef391.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中的水</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">干燥作用</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">)</span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（2）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><span class=\"qml-an  \"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/92ce84c8780f1bd6bf081218c96a20b5.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（3）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><span class=\"qml-an  \"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">排出装置中的空气</span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（4）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;①. <span class=\"qml-an  \"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">EHJ</span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;②. <span class=\"qml-an  \"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">DI</span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（5）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><span class=\"qml-an  \"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">F</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中的黑色粉末变为红色，装置</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">D</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中的石灰水变浑浊</span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（6）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><span class=\"qml-an  \"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/6d1332cb1dfecd2020034d841c22d0ff.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>",
  "explanation": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-explanation\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861842-114651791852237200-K0G_tUEVAQoyIykkjeGfWrT-ASEoUiMcxVoWY8872hg0VcBxHZpMRdNZ4lgTN_du\"><div class=\"qml-seg\" seg-name=\"分析\">【分析】<p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">浓盐酸和</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">KMnO</span><sub word-font=\"Times New Roman\"><span>4</span></sub><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">反应生成</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Cl</span><sub word-font=\"Times New Roman\"><span>2</span></sub><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，该反应放热，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中溶液温度升高，导致部分水受热变为水蒸气，浓盐酸易挥发，所以得到的氯气中含有</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">HCl</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、水蒸气，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">B</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中饱和食盐水用于除去</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">HCl</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">TiCl</span><sub word-font=\"Times New Roman\"><span>4</span></sub><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">与水剧烈反应，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中浓硫酸用于干燥氯气，将干燥氯气通入</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">G</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">装置与</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">TiO</span><sub word-font=\"Times New Roman\"><span>2</span></sub><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在加热条件下反应，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/788eaf057c2b96ec53d2cac6a6a8cb83.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的沸点为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/040fa0ce82587bf180dc7a5aea1d1371.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，所以收集</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/788eaf057c2b96ec53d2cac6a6a8cb83.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">要用冰水冷却，将产物气体通入</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">E</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">装置</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/788eaf057c2b96ec53d2cac6a6a8cb83.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">液化与</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">CO</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Cl</span><sub word-font=\"Times New Roman\"><span>2</span></sub><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分离，未反应的氯气尾气用氢氧化钠吸收，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/788eaf057c2b96ec53d2cac6a6a8cb83.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">易水解，为防止氢氧化钠溶液中水进入装置</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">E</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，在</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">E</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">J</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">之间接上</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">H</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">装置，用于吸水，生成的</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">CO</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">经干燥后再通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">F</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">装置还原氧化铜，再将生成的气体通过澄清石灰水检验，可以证明原反应中有一氧化碳生成，多余的</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">CO</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">不能排放到空气中，要用排水法收集，据此分析；</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(1)小问详解： <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">根据实验装置图可知，用高锰酸钾与浓盐酸反应制得氯气，同时生成氯化钾和氯化锰，制得的氯气中含有氯化氢和水杂质，要用饱和食盐水除去氯化氢，用浓硫酸除去水，而得到干燥纯净的氯气；根据上面的分析可知，装置</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">B</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中盛放的试剂是饱和食盐水，装置</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中装有浓硫酸，其作用是除去</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/5d69d7191f7166d1c82e92bd9c6ef391.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中的水</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">干燥作用</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(2)小问详解： <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">装置</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中高锰酸钾与浓盐酸反应制得氯气，同时生成氯化钾和氯化锰，发生反应的离子方程式为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/92ce84c8780f1bd6bf081218c96a20b5.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(3)小问详解： <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">通入氮气的作用是排尽装置内的氧气防止干扰等；</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(4)小问详解： <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">根据分析可知，乙组同学的实验装置中，依次连接的合理顺序为</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A→B→C→G→E→H→J→H→F→D→I</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(5)小问详解： <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">根据实验的原理可知，生成的</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">CO</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">能将黑色的氧化铜还原为红色的铜，同时产生能使澄清石灰水变浑的气体，所以能证明反应中有</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">CO</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">生成的现象是装置</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">F</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中黑色粉末变为红色，装置</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">D</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中澄清石灰水变浑浊；</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(6)小问详解： <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/788eaf057c2b96ec53d2cac6a6a8cb83.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">与水剧烈反应生成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b9bc62318e844fae960d7a39386196ee.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">HCl</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，化学方程式为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/81bab4b0c3b156318fc1d5357c6fb157.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div></div>",
